<title>AUSTRALIA: FAI details property trust float.</title>
<headline>FAI details property trust float.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurer FAI Insurances Ltd said on Thursday it plans to issue 113 million units in the Australian Commercial Property Trust through a public float.</p>
<p>The A$192 million trust is fully underwritten by brokers ANZ Securities and an application would be made to list the trust on the Australian Stock Exchange, FAI said in a short statement.</p>
<p>FAI said following the issue it would maintain an interest of 31 million units out of a total of 144 million units or 21.5 percent of the trust.  </p>
<p>It said the issue would be made through its subsidiary FAI Funds Management Ltd, which had lodged a prospectus with the Australian Securities Commission (ASC).</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
